SUMMARY:Accessibility
DESCRIPTION:Accessibility Statement Al-Qadisiyah University is committed to making its website accessible to all users.\nOur Commitments Design compliant with WCAG 2.1 standards Screen reader support Appropriate color contrast Alternative text for images Keyboard navigation Assistance If you encounter any accessibility difficulties:\nEmail: accessibility@qu.edu.iq Phone: +964 780 000 0000 Report an Issue We welcome your feedback to improve accessibility.\n
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
